    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect cavity stack on fused silica substrate at normal incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2(defect)|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2. Constrain layer 10 (defect, HfO2) physical thickness to 480-550 nm range. Apply L2 regularization penalty on layers 0-9 and 11-20 toward quarter-wave optical thickness at 1550 nm. Maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with bounded constraints. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
